OL,3,GNEWSAFallen WWI soldier's rugby-playing
OL,4,Apast revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe forgotten life story of a former
OL,7,Frugby player who died days after
OL,8,Freturning to the WWI trenches following
OL,9,Fan injury has been uncovered 100 years
OL,10,Fafter his death.
OL,12,FHistorian and broadcaster, David
OL,13,FOlusoga discovered the story of James
OL,14,FEdward Friend using the website
OL,15,FFindmypast, which connects names on war
OL,16,Fmemorials with historical records.
OL,18,FFriend was among the first volunteers
OL,19,Fto join Bristol's Own Battalion and
OL,20,Freturned to the Western Front in 1916
OL,21,Fafter surviving a serious injury, only
OL,22,Fto lose his life two days later.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
