OL,3,GNEWSAFallen WWI soldier's rugby-playing
OL,4,Apast revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FOlusoga said his research revealed the
OL,7,Fstory of a man who grew up singing in a
OL,8,Fchoir and playing rugby, who left
OL,9,FBristol Temple Meads to fight in the
OL,10,Fwar with his friends.
